      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_49",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "All right, listen to me: go to the Garbage, to the depot. There you'll find the foundations of an old railroad crane, take a good look at it.",
      "JA_current": "All right, listen to me: go to the Garbage, to the depot. There you'll find the foundations of an old railroad crane, take a good look at it.",
      "JA_new": "よし、よく聞け。ガーベジの貨物置き場へ行け。古い鉄道クレーンの土台があるから、よく調べてみな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
